ted source records\n                    - list [ref=f1e547]:\n                      - listitem [ref=f1e548]:\n                        - strong [ref=f1e549]: Lesson\n                        - text: \": Planned representative-transfer lesson\"\n                        - generic [ref=f1e550]: · reviewed at roadmap revision 9\n                        - paragraph [ref=f1e551]: The selected synthetic sample showed a wider strike window when transition tempo increased.\n                        - list [ref=f1e552]:\n                          - listitem [ref=f1e553]: \"Evidence: Selected launch-monitor comparison context (comparison)\"\n                          - listitem [ref=f1e554]: \"Measurement session: Synthetic current vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-08-04\"\n                          - listitem [ref=f1e555]: \"Measurement session: Synthetic baseline vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-07-14\"\n                      - listitem [ref=f1e556]:\n                        - strong [ref=f1e557]: Practice\n                        - text: \": Editable centered-contact window\"\n                      - listitem [ref=f1e558]:\n                        - strong [ref=f1e559]: Launch Session\n                        - text: \": Synthetic baseline vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-07-14\"\n                      - listitem [ref=f1e560]:\n                        - strong [ref=f1e561]: Launch Session\n                        - text: \": Synthetic current vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-08-04\"\n                      - listitem [ref=f1e562]:\n                        - strong [ref=f1e563]: Launch Comparison\n                        - text: \": Selected synthetic baseline and current values\"\n                      - listitem [ref=f1e564]:\n                        - strong [ref=f1e565]: Evidence\n                        - text: \": Selected launch-monitor comparison context\"\n                  - generic [ref