rection\n                    - generic [ref=f1e589]: Synthetic QA package. Confirm current terms with the coach.\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e590]: You will leave Roadmap. Booking or payment happens on the coach's external service and is not complete until that service confirms it.\n                - generic [ref=f1e591]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e592]:\n                    - text: Choose without pressure\n                    - heading \"What would you like to do next?\" [level=3] [ref=f1e593]\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e594]: \"Preview only: these are the choices the golfer will receive. Controls are disabled and nothing is recorded for Coach Rowan.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e595]:\n                    - button \"Continue to the coach’s external page\" [disabled] [ref=f1e596]\n                    - button \"Ask Coach Rowan a question\" [disabled] [ref=f1e597]\n                    - button \"Review later\" [disabled] [ref=f1e598]\n                    - button \"Request reassessment\" [disabled] [ref=f1e599]\n                    - button \"Practise independently\" [disabled] [ref=f1e600]\n                    - button \"Not pursuing this option\" [disabled] [ref=f1e601]\n            - generic [ref=f1e602]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e603]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e604]: CR\n                - generic [ref=f1e605]:\n                  - strong [ref=f1e606]: Foothills Golf Studio\n                  - generic [ref=f1e607]: Coach-authored private development plan\n              - generic [ref=f1e608]: Updated Aug 11, 2026\n      - generic [ref=f1e610]:\n        - region [ref=f1e611]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e612]: Lessons\n          - heading \"1 retained chapter\" [level=2] [ref=f1e613]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e614]: \"Latest: Planned representative-transfer lesson\"\n          - link \"Review latest lesson\" [ref=f1e615] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /app/coaching/plans/c52fb675-e5ee-481a-86