Next useful action\n                    - strong [ref=f1e256]: Editable centered-contact window\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e257]: Three sets of four synthetic repetitions with a full reset between sets.\n                - blockquote [ref=f1e258]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e259]: Coach Rowan's current takeaway\n                  - text: “Keep the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal.”\n              - generic [ref=f1e260]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e261]:\n                  - text: Your goal\n                  - heading \"Build predictable contact through a full league round.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e262]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e263]: Play confidently without guarding against a two-way miss.\n                - generic [ref=f1e264]:\n                  - article [ref=f1e265]:\n                    - text: Real-life context\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e266]: Synthetic functional QA scenario for Coach Rowan.\n                  - article [ref=f1e267]:\n                    - text: Honest boundary\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e268]: This plan supports the goal. It does not guarantee a score, result, timeline, or permanent change.\n              - generic [ref=f1e269]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e270]:\n                  - text: Development roadmap\n                  - heading \"Predictable contact roadmap\" [level=2] [ref=f1e271]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e272]: A directional sequence authored by your coach. Later phases can change as new evidence develops.\n                - generic [ref=f1e273]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e274]:\n                    - text: Starting assessment\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e275]: Strike drifts toward the heel when transition tempo increases.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e276]:\n                    - text: Strengths to preserve\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e277]: Athletic setup and accurate awareness of strike location.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e278]:\n                    - text: Primary pattern\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e279]: Heel contact appears as transition tempo increases.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e280]:\n                    - text: Evidence limits\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e281]: A small indoor sample does not prove transfer to the course.\n                - list [ref=f1e282]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e283]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e284]: \"01\"\n                    - generic [ref=f1e285]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e286]: Current phase\n                      - strong [ref=f1e287]: Own centered contact\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e288]: Create a stable strike window at controlled tempo.\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e289]: \"Why this phase leads: Centered contact is the narrowest observed foundation.\"\n                      - generic [ref=f1e290]:\n                        - text: Progress signals\n                        - list [ref=f1e291]:\n                          - listitem [ref=f1e292]: Centered contact repeats in a coach-reviewed set.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e293]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e294]: \"02\"\n                    - generic [ref=f1e295]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e296]: Planned phase\n                      - strong [ref=f1e297]: Shape trajectory\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e298]: Add launch windows without losing contact quality.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e299]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e300]: \"03\"\n                    - generic [ref=f1e301]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e302]: Planned phase\n                      - strong [ref=f1e303]: Choose targets\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e304]: Transfer the pattern into representative decisions.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e305]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e306]: \"04\"\n                    - generic [ref=f1e307]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e308]: Planned phase\n                      - strong [ref=f1e309]: Perform under pressure\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e310]: Test the pattern with scored constraints.\n              - generic [ref=f1e311]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e312]:\n                  - text: Lesson chapters\n                  - heading \"What mattered, in the coach's words.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e313]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e314]: Concise chapters preserve direction without becoming a transcript or media archive. This bounded view shows up to 12 chapters, prioritizing the current phase before the newest retained history.\n                - article [ref=f1e316]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e317]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e318]: Lesson 1\n                    - time [ref=f1e319]: Aug 4, 2026\n                  - heading \"Planned representative-transfer lesson\" [level=3] [ref=f1e320]\n                  - text: Completed\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e321]: Review the current contact window, preserve the golfer's stated priorities, and choose the next bounded evidence task.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e322]:\n                    - term [ref=f1e323]: Coach observation\n                    - definition [ref=f1e324]: The selected synthetic sample showed a wider strike window when transition tempo increased.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e325]:\n                    - term [ref=f1e326]: Takeaway\n                    - definition [ref=f1e327]: Keep the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e328]:\n                    - term [ref=f1e329]: Next check\n                    - definition [ref=f1e330]: Repeat the representative set before changing the task.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e331]:\n                    - term [ref=f1e332]: Golfer learning\n                    - definition [ref=f1e333]: The synthetic golfer reported that the reset made the target decision easier to repeat.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e334]:\n                    - term [ref=f1e335]: Phase connection\n                    - definition [ref=f1e336]: This lesson establishes evidence for the current phase review.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e337]:\n                    - term [ref=f1e338]: Selected evidence from this lesson\n                    - definition [ref=f1e339]:\n                      - list [ref=f1e340]:\n                        - listitem [ref=f1e341]:\n                          - link \"Selected launch-monitor comparison context\" [ref=f1e342] [cursor=pointer]:\n                            - /url: \"#evidence-95bbeece-7b1e-4f3d-bf19-f81416817eae\"\n                          - text: · Comparison · The bounded comparison supports continuing the current priority while gathering more representative evidence.\n                  - generic [ref=f1e343]:\n                    - term [ref=f1e344]: Selected measurement sessions from this lesson\n                    - definition [ref=f1e345]:\n                      - list [ref=f1e346]:\n                        - listitem [ref=f1e347]:\n                          - strong [ref=f1e348]: Synthetic current vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · Aug 4, 2026\n                          - paragraph [ref=f1e349]: Use the selected values only as bounded context for the coach-authored current priority.\n                          - text: \"Ball Speed: 134.8 mph · Carry: 212 yd · Launch Angle: 14.8 deg\"\n                        - listitem [ref=f1e350]:\n                          - strong [ref=f1e351]: Synthetic baseline vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · Jul 14, 2026\n                          - paragraph [ref=f1e352]: Use the selected values only as bounded context for the coach-authored current priority.\n                          - text: \"Ball Speed: 131.2 mph · Carry: 205 yd · Launch Angle: 14.1 deg\"\n              - generic [ref=f1e353]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e354]:\n                  - text: Practice direction\n                  - heading \"One focused task before more complexity.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e355]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e356]: Practice is coach-authored and should match the current phase and available evidence. This bounded view shows up to 8 items, prioritizing current-phase direction before the newest retained history.\n                - list [ref=f1e357]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e358]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e359]: \"1\"\n                    - generic [ref=f1e360]:\n                      - text: active\n                      - heading \"Editable centered-contact window\" [level=3] [ref=f1e361]\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e362]: Make four swings at a comfortable tempo. Record only the agreed strike-location feedback. Reset fully before the next set. Stop if discomfort or uncertainty appears.\n                      - strong [ref=f1e363]: Three sets of four synthetic repetitions with a full reset between sets.\n                      - emphasis [ref=f1e364]: \"Look for: The agreed strike window repeats in the coach-defined representative set.\"\n                      - group [ref=f1e365]:\n                        - generic \"Full drill guidance\" [ref=f1e366] [cursor=pointer]\n                      - generic [ref=f1e367]:\n                        - group \"Quick practice check-in\" [ref=f1e368]:\n                          - generic [ref=f1e370]:\n                            - generic [ref=f1e371]:\n                              - radio \"Completed\" [disabled] [ref=f1e372]\n                              - text: Completed\n                            - generic [ref=f1e373]:\n                              - radio \"Not completed\" [disabled] [ref=f1e374]\n                              - text: Not completed\n                          - generic [ref=f1e375]:\n                            - generic [ref=f1e376]:\n                              - text: Difficulty (optional)\n                              - combobox \"Difficulty (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=f1e377]:\n                                - option \"Choose\" [disabled] [selected]\n                                - option \"Very easy\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"Easy\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"About right\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"Hard\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"Very hard\" [disabled]\n                            - generic [ref=f1e378]:\n                              - text: Confidence (optional)\n                              - combobox \"Confidence (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=f1e379]:\n                                - option \"Choose\" [disabled] [selected]\n                                - option \"1 — not confident\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"2\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"3\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"4\" [disabled]\n                                - option \"5 — very confident\" [disabled]\n                          - generic [ref=f1e380]:\n                            - text: Short note (optional)\n                            - textbox \"Short note (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=f1e381]:\n                              - /placeholder: What did you notice?\n                          - generic [ref=f1e382]:\n                            - checkbox \"I would like help from my coach\" [disabled] [ref=f1e383]\n                            - text: I would like help from my coach\n                          - button \"Preview only\" [disabled] [ref=f1e384]\n                        - status [ref=f1e385]: The live private roadmap enables this form. Coach preview records nothing.\n              - generic [ref=f1e386]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e387]:\n                  - text: Selected swing media\n                  - heading \"Clips and images chosen by your coach.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e388]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e389]: Nothing autoplays and Roadmap does not analyze the swing. Captions and coach context explain why each item belongs in this exact roadmap revision.\n                - generic [ref=f1e390]:\n                  - strong [ref=f1e391]: No media is selected for this revision.\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e392]: The complete text-first roadmap remains available on any connection.\n              - generic [ref=f1e393]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e394]:\n                  - text: Selected launch data\n                  - heading \"What changed, with the coach’s interpretation.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e395]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e396]: Only selected like-for-like metrics appear. Units are preserved exactly; missing values are never filled or converted.\n                - article [ref=f1e398]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e399]:\n                    - text: Baseline / current\n                    - heading \"Selected synthetic baseline and current values\" [level=3] [ref=f1e400]\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e401]: The selected current values differ from the bounded baseline; the coach uses them only as context for the existing priority.\n                    - generic [ref=f1e402]: \"Limit: These synthetic indoor summary values are a selected interface fixture, not a diagnosis, forecast, score claim, or proof of transfer.\"\n                    - generic [ref=f1e403]: \"Next evidence: Repeat a representative coach-reviewed set under an ordinary target constraint.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e404]:\n                    - 'figure \"Ball Speed Change: +3.6 mph\" [ref=f1e405]':\n                      - generic [ref=f1e406]:\n                        - strong [ref=f1e407]: Ball Speed\n                        - generic [ref=f1e408]: \"Change: