e-169ec55013a3?tab=reviews\n      - region [ref=f1e637]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e639]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e640]: Living coaching records\n          - heading \"Add the next useful chapter.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e641]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e642]: Lesson, practice, evidence, and review mutations retain their existing recovery controls.\n        - region [ref=f1e643]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e645]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e646]: Living plan updates\n            - heading \"Add only the next useful chapter.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e647]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e648]: Every update creates a new plan revision and revokes previous access until you review and republish the exact golfer view.\n          - group [ref=f1e649]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e650]:\n              - group [ref=f1e651]:\n                - generic \"Add a completed lesson chapter\" [ref=f1e652]\n                - option \"Phase 1 — Own centered contact\" [selected]\n                - option \"Phase 2 — Shape trajectory\"\n                - option \"Phase 3 — Choose targets\"\n                - option \"Phase 4 — Perform under pressure\"\n              - group [ref=f1e653]:\n                - generic \"Add or replace the current practice direction\" [ref=f1e654]\n                - option \"Phase 1 — Own centered contact\" [selected]\n                - option \"Phase 2 — Shape trajectory\"\n                - option \"Phase 3 — Choose targets\"\n                - option \"Phase 4 — Perform under pressure\"\n              - group [ref=f1e655]:\n                - generic \"Add evidence with its limits\" [ref=f1e656]\n                - option \"Phase 1 — Own centered contact\" [selected]\n                - option \"Phase 2 — Shape trajectory\"\n                - option \"Phase 3 — Choose targets\"\n                - option \"Phase 4 — Perform under pressure\"\n                - option \"Coach observation\" [selected]\n                - option \"Golfer report\"\n                - option \"Measurement\"\n                - option \"Outcome count\"\n                - option \"Comparison\"\n                - option \"Note\"\n                - option \"Assessment\"\n                - option \"Lesson\"\n                - option \"Practice\" [selected]\n                - option \"On course\"\n                - option \"Phase review\"\n                - option \"Other\"\n                - option \"Coach observed\" [selected]\n                - option \"Golfer reported\"\n                - option \"Device\"\n                - option \"Document\"\n                - option \"Mixed\"\n                - option \"Single observation\" [selected]\n                - option \"Early indication\"\n                - option \"Repeated practice\"\n                - option \"On-course observation\"\n                - option \"Insufficient\"\n                - option \"Standalone\" [selected]\n                - option \"Baseline\"\n                - option \"Current\"\n                - option \"No or not established\" [selected]\n                - option \"Yes — coach selected\"\n              - group [ref=f1e657]:\n                - generic \"Complete a source-backed phase review\" [ref=f1e658]\n              - group [ref=f1e659]:\n                - generic \"Correct or withdraw existing golfer-view content\" [ref=f1e660]\n          - alert [ref=f1e661]\n      - region [ref=f1e662]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e664]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e665]: Share\n          - heading \"Private access for one reviewed revision.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e666]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e667]: Publishing creates revocable access; Roadmap still does not send a message automatically.\n        - region [ref=f1e668]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e670]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e671]: Authorization control\n            - heading \"Private roadmap sharing\" [level=2] [ref=f1e672]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e673]: Synthetic authorization for test-only private roadmap sharing; no real person is represented.\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e674]: \"Policy version: synthetic-roadmap-sharing-v1\"\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e675]: \"Current state: authorized\"\n          - button \"Withdraw authorization\" [ref=f1e676] [cursor=pointer]\n        - region [ref=f1e677]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e679]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e680]: Publish & share\n            - heading \"Review the exact golfer view before creating access.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e681]\n          - group \"Private link details\" [ref=f1e683]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e685]:\n              - text: Intended recipient and context\n              - textbox \"Intended recipient and context Confirm who should receive this exact private view. Roadmap does not send it automatically.\" [disabled] [ref=f1e686]: Jordan Synthetic — private golfer roadmap\n              - generic [ref=f1e687]: Confirm who should receive this exact private view. Roadmap does not send it automatically.\n            - generic [ref=f1e688]:\n              - text: Link expiry\n              - combobox \"Link expiry You can revoke access sooner from the sharing record.\" [disabled] [ref=f1e689]:\n                - option \"1 day\" [disabled]\n                - option \"7 days\" [disabled]\n                - option \"30 days\" [disabled] [selected]\n                - option \"90 days\" [disabled]\n              - generic [ref=f1e690]: You can revoke access sooner from the sharing record.\n            - generic [ref=f1e691]:\n              - checkbox \"I reviewed the exact goal, assessment, evidence limits, phase sequence, package facts, and external-action wording shown below.\" [disabled] [ref=f1e692]\n              - generic [ref=f1e693]: I reviewed the exact goal, assessment, evidence limits, phase sequence, package facts, and external-action wording shown below.\n            - button \"Current revision already has private access\" [disabled] [ref=f1e695]\n          - form [ref=f1e696]:\n            - group \"Inaccessible-link replacement\" [ref=f1e697]:\n              - note [ref=f1e699]:\n                - strong [ref=f1e700]: Cannot access the one-time link shown after publishing?\n                - generic [ref=f1e701]: Reload and inspect the sharing record first if a publish response was lost. Roadmap stores only a one-way fingerprint, so it cannot recover the old link. This action revokes the currently active link and every open session, then creates one replacement with the same recipient context and expiry.\n              - generic [ref=f1e702]:\n                - checkbox \"I cannot access the current private link and understand that replacing it immediately invalidates that link and its open sessions.\" [ref=f1e703]\n                - generic [ref=f1e704]: I cannot access the current private link and understand that replacing it immediately invalidates that link and its open sessions.\n              - button \"Revoke and replace inaccessible link\" [ref=f1e706] [cursor=pointer]\n          - alert [ref=f1e707]\n          - generic [ref=f1e708]:\n            - heading \"Private access history\" [level=3] [ref=f1e709]\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e710]: A link is not a delivered message or a confirmed read. “Opened” means only that the capability reached Roadmap successfully.\n            - generic [ref=f1e711]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e712]:\n                - strong [ref=f1e713]: Active private link\n                - generic [ref=f1e714]: Created 2026-08-11, 3:19:32 a.m. · expires 2026-08-18, 3:19:32 a.m. · not opened\n              - button \"Revoke access\" [ref=f1e715] [cursor=pointer]\n            - generic [ref=f1e717]:\n              - strong [ref=f1e718]: Link revoked\n              - generic [ref=f1e719]: Created 2026-08-11, 3:19:32 a.m. · expires 2026-08-12, 3:19:32 a.m. · not opened\n      - region [ref=f1e720]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e722]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e723]: Golfer choices\n          - heading \"Recorded response history\" [level=2] [ref=f1e724]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e725]: An external-page open is not evidence of a booking, payment, sale, or coaching outcome. Question and reassessment choices do not send a message.\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e726]: No golfer choice has been recorded for this plan."}}
